[{"id":"30134609-a185-410f-b1e3-0eab3438c9e9","slug":"building-my-admin-website","title":"Building My Admin Website","excerpt":"A Simple, Secure Way to Manage My Portfolio & Blog","content":"<pre>Keeping a website up to date shouldn’t be hard. I built a lightweight admin website that lets me manage my portfolio, blog content, and images—all in one place—without touching code.</pre><h2>Why I Built It</h2><p><b>I wanted an admin tool that is:</b></p><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Easy to use: Clean forms instead of editing files.\n</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Fast to update: Publish changes in seconds.\nSecure: Private access with modern authentication.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Scalable: Cloud database and storage</span></li></ul><p></p><h2>T<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">he Stack (Simple, Fast, Reliable)</span></h2><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Frontend: React + Vite (snappy dev server, optimized builds).\n</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Database: Supabase (Postgres) for structured data and relations.\nAuth: Supabase Auth for secure login and sessions.\n</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Storage: Supabase Storage for images and media.\nAPIs: Direct Supabase client for CRUD (no extra backend needed).</span></li></ul><span style=\"background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span><p></p><p></p>","tag":"React, supabase","cover_url":"https://plqvyrdvuinsmiudmwek.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Postimg/covers/1761168127615-trbyt39xj1.png?v=1761168128948","author_id":null,"published_at":"2025-09-09T11:52:59.403643+00:00","created_at":"2025-09-09T11:52:59.403643+00:00","project_url":null,"gallery_urls":["https://plqvyrdvuinsmiudmwek.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/Postimg/post-gallery/1763000339860-3tw